# serializer version: 1
# name: test_from_dict_earlier_version
  "The algorithm configuration misses the keys 'algorithm_settings_class' and 'algorithm_settings'; it was probably written by an earlier version of gemseo-benchmark and must be computed again."
# ---
# name: test_from_dict_missing_keys[all_keys]
  "The algorithm configuration misses the keys 'configuration_name', 'algorithm_settings_class' and 'algorithm_settings'; it was probably written by an earlier version of gemseo-benchmark and must be computed again."
# ---
# name: test_from_dict_missing_keys[one_key]
  "The algorithm configuration misses the key 'algorithm_settings_class'; it was probably written by an earlier version of gemseo-benchmark and must be computed again."
