# name: test_from_dict_unknown_settings_class[gemseo.algos.opt.mma.settings.mma_settings.MMASVanberg_Settings]
  "The class of the algorithm settings 'gemseo.algos.opt.mma.settings.mma_settings.MMASVanberg_Settings' cannot be imported; install the plugin providing the algorithm, or, if the results were written by an earlier version of gemseo-benchmark, compute them again."
